# Vaultwarden folder: homelab
# No committed secret values are required for the MVP default reverse-proxy-auth deployment.
# Non-secret live-render inputs can be copied from .env.example.
#
# If Ben later chooses app-level shared-password auth, create an item such as:
# item,field,env
# personal-dashboard/auth,shared-password,DASHBOARD_SHARED_PASSWORD
# personal-dashboard/auth,session-secret,DASHBOARD_SESSION_SECRET
#
# If Cloudflare public-hostname/DNS changes are automated instead of done in the
# Zero Trust dashboard, use this existing/expected API item and keep values local:
# cloudflare/api,api_token,CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN
# cloudflare/api,zone_id,CLOUDFLARE_ZONE_ID
# cloudflare/api,account_id,CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID
